{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_049mom_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_049mom_001_1000_p", "source_sha256": "254bd1e7d0e28b856b881a7a1f5ac90161990a1f3645cea794a4c3231bda535b", "ja": "（今日は、社長が39プロジェクトのメンバーに\n加えたいと言っていた子との面接だ）", "zh": "（今天要面试一位\n社长希望推荐加入39PROJECT的女孩。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_049mom_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_049mom_001_1001_p", "source_sha256": "8bce5150aeb534c33568095406e0577d9c0496ee5c22de51730dc4e15aeee4d1", "ja": "（名前は、周防桃子。なんでも数年前まで、\n子役として活躍していたらしいけど……）", "zh": "（名字叫做周防桃子。\n据说好几年前是个很活跃的童星……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_049mom_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_049mom_001_1002_049mom", "source_sha256": "9cad90e22d92736fbcd4be5dd4bab12358ee0c12362e0bae4375487bb6dc2a9b", "ja": "ん……よいしょ。", "zh": "嗯……嘿咻。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_049mom_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_049mom_001_1003_p", "source_sha256": "21f3ba22ab959b625d987952672c9ffd7414fc77a7bb0349db076c90f8c32b26", "ja": "（部屋に入るなり、踏み台に乗った……！？）", "zh": "（一进门就站上垫脚凳……！？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_049mom_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_049mom_001_1004_049mom", "source_sha256": "3dea96685ec88ca699a7f1a23031b30e99d8ab029cd37c6747d071ce36c07f1c", "ja": "はじめまして、周防桃子です。\n以前は子役として活動していました。", "zh": "你好，我叫做周防桃子。\n以前曾经当过童星。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_049mom_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_049mom_001_1005_p", "source_sha256": "15deb5be2b444322f229b1d5d738b311d320e8ee2b0d233f62593ae720881516", "ja": "こんにちは。今日、君の面接を\n担当させてもらいます。よろしく。", "zh": "你好，今天由我负责你的面试。\n请多指教。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_049mom_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_049mom_001_1006_049mom", "source_sha256": "68d9a08103be3ec1efc5d478b3124cc82aa982c212c331aef92b6af010799576", "ja": "あの……お兄ちゃんが面接するってことは、\n受かったら、お兄ちゃんが桃子の担当になるの？", "zh": "请问……由大哥哥你面试，\n所以桃子如果录取了，大哥哥就会负责培育桃子吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_049mom_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_049mom_001_1007_p", "source_sha256": "168f46a16edaefde521807834a4b85f523390ceba9f24e32955e3bd81a074b21", "ja": "ああ、そうだよ。\n俺が君のプロデューサーだ。", "zh": "对的，没有错。\n我将会成为你的制作人。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_049mom_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_049mom_001_1008_049mom", "source_sha256": "32aa8ee002407d9b9975c76383146b160a3569f5f55290b2deb7f78a34e5d11e", "ja": "ふ～ん……。", "zh": "是喔……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_049mom_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_049mom_001_1009_p", "source_sha256": "905e4e24f54fcc2d2b0a5e5c8c4f0be1198975b48ff6193761ec4e1f5e528a42", "ja": "（不安なのかな……無理もない。\n芸能界経験者とはいえ、ブランクもあるし……）", "zh": "（她觉得很不安吗……这也难怪。\n尽管待过演艺圈，毕竟还是有段空窗期……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_049mom_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_049mom_001_1010_049mom", "source_sha256": "ba955c648797c9df53d1738730e6b0596ac7d9ecb33bc1af59e13c07b11de358", "ja": "お兄ちゃんって、なんだか頼りなさそう。\n本当に大丈夫なの？", "zh": "大哥哥，我觉得你不太可靠。\n真的没问题吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_049mom_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_049mom_001_1011_p", "source_sha256": "2f6015246c7896136ef1b82bc83f329d3175e7100fc704a499ca5bd5754ecc59", "ja": "えっ。", "zh": "呃？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_049mom_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_049mom_001_1012_049mom", "source_sha256": "281340dac2be9d8431562e581440fb68a7cbf846012a2fcc448fe5e8fd44251b", "ja": "言っておくけど、桃子はプロだから。\n中途半端な仕事したら、承知しないからね。", "zh": "丑话先说在前头，桃子可是专业的。\n要是你做事情不够确实，桃子可饶不了你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_049mom_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_049mom_001_1013_049mom", "source_sha256": "9008cca902c87d17a44ab406813811d4d1de3077938ff646fc04a699e5beae85", "ja": "いい？　桃子のプロデューサーになるっていうなら、\nお兄ちゃんもそのつもりでいてよね！", "zh": "听懂了吗？如果大哥哥想要担任桃子的制作人，\n就要做好心理准备！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_049mom_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_049mom_001_1014_p", "source_sha256": "c38dbc0c4d0921007e388143d293f1945bea95eeefc68091144035644b103662", "ja": "（……ずいぶんと自信家みたいだな！\nつまり裏を返せば、プロ意識が高いということ……）", "zh": "（……看来她相当有自信！\n反过来说，这也表示她极为敬业……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_049mom_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_049mom_001_1015", "source_sha256": "82ba7c0d8c36a1f2eea44a72c4f98c86ac32928739faf770b0e6dad375a952d7", "ja": "合格だ！", "zh": "录取！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_049mom_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_049mom_001_2000_p", "source_sha256": "94335fb89b924d487c52e8b4dc1bce71e0ef8ce55ccc84ac93a54940230ff1d0", "ja": "うん、いいね！\n合格だ！", "zh": "嗯，非常好！\n录取！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_049mom_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_049mom_001_2001_049mom", "source_sha256": "9c2481e0fd878d47b1871e9d301f68c1c4da0e735879a5602c591240ae3c3ced", "ja": "は？　合格って……。", "zh": "什么？录取……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_049mom_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_049mom_001_2002_p", "source_sha256": "2041c32ee71e683b8ad02a4d43c5fde82fdc54f74b07ad0330db82d3134943a7", "ja": "君なら、きっとすごいアイドルになると思う。\n是非、俺にプロデュースさせてほしい！", "zh": "我觉得你一定能成为很棒的偶像。\n希望你务必让我培育！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_049mom_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_049mom_001_2003_049mom", "source_sha256": "67b2f8cad42a33480e84fff93a64547bdbab4c98fed08c5515069cc4dc37fc80", "ja": "え……アイドル？　ちょっと待って！\n桃子、そんな話聞いてないんだけど。", "zh": "咦……偶像？等一下！\n没人跟桃子说过啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_049mom_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_049mom_001_2004_049mom", "source_sha256": "33bb336add26ebbb39b698458c3604f37d5d8a7850618fbf2da830bd0b282ba5", "ja": "また演技のお仕事ができるって言うから、\n桃子は来たんだよ。アイドルなんて、聞いてない！", "zh": "桃子听说可以再接到戏剧工作，\n所以才过来的。根本不知道这是在甄选偶像！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_049mom_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_049mom_001_2005_p", "source_sha256": "bad44ce8a6be54396f915291b27afe4f9ca72a45040cac7093439b9908f064ce", "ja": "アイドルにも演技の仕事はあるよ。\nそれに、君には色々な可能性があると思うんだ。", "zh": "偶像也会有戏剧通告啊。\n而且，我认为你还拥有更多不同的可能性。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_049mom_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_049mom_001_2006_049mom", "source_sha256": "908fc7fc571586855a48e0af3e7f7fa0e1eabadce9ba11639fe69e28b3bb3e26", "ja": "色々な……可能性……？", "zh": "不同的……可能性……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_049mom_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_049mom_001_2007_p", "source_sha256": "0763bd3a6fb3c6f4ca89cf4b3d9c52c2cde44782472a7e09b3585c1d84e8cd06", "ja": "そう。今から女優1本に絞るより、アイドルとして、\nいろんな経験を積んだ方がいいと思う！", "zh": "没错。与其这么早就专注在演员事业，\n我认为不如先当偶像，累积各种经验比较好！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_049mom_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_049mom_001_2008_p", "source_sha256": "5f0387c4937797b57b4ca04760dd63508d03be8694ace72ca781ecd30b106435", "ja": "だから俺に、君をプロデュースさせてくれないか？", "zh": "所以，可以让我来培育你吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_049mom_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_049mom_001_2009_049mom", "source_sha256": "f8d44f71c612975ecfb603e1ffc75e1aafd82242255dd642512192d7c0ce0e7f", "ja": "い、いま会ったばかりなのに、可能性とか……。\nそんなこと、どうしてわかるの？", "zh": "我、我们明明才刚见面不久，哪来什么可能性……\n你为什么会这么肯定？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_049mom_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_049mom_001_2010_p", "source_sha256": "42ea710c97245f290e2d9456bc2af088ac1189404e23b74c56b2580d6902a9d1", "ja": "これでも、アイドルのプロデューサーだからね。\n自分の目には自信を持ってる！", "zh": "因为我好歹也是偶像制作人啊。\n我对自己的眼光有信心！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_049mom_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_049mom_001_2011_049mom", "source_sha256": "1ddae2cd5bf2bfdc5b5d344836eba2c19f698b576fc332570be9e5ea85f693bb", "ja": "……。\nふ、ふーん。", "zh": "……\n这、这样啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_049mom_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_049mom_001_2012_049mom", "source_sha256": "890dd8081bf6dd3290c1f0d03b92be9cba4525dfbd1fcfa8d288c5f77b69d066", "ja": "まだ、ちょっと信用できないけど……。\nそこまで言うなら、アイドルになってあげてもいいよ。", "zh": "虽然还不太能放心相信你……\n不过既然你这么坚持，桃子也是可以来当偶像。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_049mom_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_049mom_001_2013_p", "source_sha256": "0bcfa8d1cf9e4f53ce59f7f01a9f6a7b10de9ec5fa12ee30dac3f9f3977f122a", "ja": "本当か？　ありがとう！\nこれから一緒に頑張ろうな！", "zh": "真的吗？谢谢你！\n以后一起加油吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_049mom_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_049mom_001_2014_049mom", "source_sha256": "53965dbc76767db4a8d80c2cae3a8e6563d1da4287e93c439501d1c541b2c5b8", "ja": "言っておくけど、業界では桃子のほうが先輩だからね！\nよろしく、お兄ちゃん。", "zh": "丑话先说在前头，在演艺圈中，桃子才是前辈哦！\n请多指教，大哥哥。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_049mom_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_049mom_001_2015_p", "source_sha256": "359ecb87100f30030c284e3223762b0b8d2077a4dcbccf8aa614ed9884e95029", "ja": "（なかなか大変そうな子だけど……\n二人三脚で一緒に駆け抜けていこう！）", "zh": "（感觉培育她并不容易……\n和她一起同心协力突破难关吧！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
